# Fase 1 - Warehouse Cloud Platform
# E-02: coleccion de pruebas HTTP.
#
# Ejecutar en orden sobre una bodega de desarrollo.
# Utilizar un SKU nuevo para repetir la coleccion.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8000
@apiKey = dev-api-key
@sku = E02-HTTP-001


### 1.1 Health check - Esperado: 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/health


### 1.2 Readiness - Esperado: 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/health/ready


### 2. Sin API key - Esperado: 401
GET {{baseUrl}}/products


### 3.1 Crear producto - Esperado: 201
# @name createProduct
POST {{baseUrl}}/products
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "sku": "{{sku}}",
    "name": "Laptop Lenovo",
    "description": "Producto de prueba E-02",
    "category": "Tecnologia",
    "unit": "unidad"
}


### 3.2 SKU duplicado - Esperado: 409
POST {{baseUrl}}/products
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "sku": "{{sku}}",
    "name": "Laptop duplicada",
    "unit": "unidad"
}


### 4.1 Listar productos - Esperado: 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/products
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}


### 4.2 Consultar producto - Esperado: 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/products/{{createProduct.response.body.$.id}}
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}


### 5. Actualizar producto - Esperado: 200
PUT {{baseUrl}}/products/{{createProduct.response.body.$.id}}
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Laptop Lenovo ThinkPad",
    "category": "Computadores"
}


### 6. Registrar entrada - Esperado: 201
POST {{baseUrl}}/inventory/movements
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "sku": "{{sku}}",
    "type": "RECEIPT",
    "quantity": 10,
    "reference": "ENTRADA-E02"
}


### 7. Consultar inventario - Esperado: 10 unidades
GET {{baseUrl}}/inventory/{{sku}}
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}


### 8. Registrar salida - Esperado: 201
POST {{baseUrl}}/inventory/movements
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "sku": "{{sku}}",
    "type": "SHIPMENT",
    "quantity": 4,
    "reference": "SALIDA-E02"
}


### 8.1 Verificar stock - Esperado: 6 unidades
GET {{baseUrl}}/inventory/{{sku}}
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}


### 9. Stock insuficiente - Esperado: 409
POST {{baseUrl}}/inventory/movements
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "sku": "{{sku}}",
    "type": "SHIPMENT",
    "quantity": 15,
    "reference": "SALIDA-INVALIDA-E02"
}


### 9.1 Verificar rollback - Esperado: 6 unidades
GET {{baseUrl}}/inventory/{{sku}}
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}


### 10. Ajuste fisico - Esperado: 201, diferencia -1
POST {{baseUrl}}/inventory/movements
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "sku": "{{sku}}",
    "type": "ADJUSTMENT",
    "quantity": 5,
    "reference": "CONTEO-E02"
}


### 10.1 Verificar ajuste - Esperado: 5 unidades
GET {{baseUrl}}/inventory/{{sku}}
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}


### 11. Historial - Esperado: 3 movimientos
GET {{baseUrl}}/inventory/{{sku}}/movements
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}


### 12. Eliminar producto con movimientos - Esperado: 409
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/products/{{createProduct.response.body.$.id}}
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}
